        "## 2. Operator\n",
        "\n",
        "Operator adalah simbol-simbol yang dapat kita gunakan untuk memanipulasi data atau nilai dalam variable. Secara umum, terdapat 3 jenis operator, yakni:\n",
        "\n",
        "- Operator aritmatika\n",
        "- Operator perbandingan\n",
        "- Operator logika"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "NPwhsmVrlz2Y"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 2.1 Operator Aritmatika\n",
        "\n",
        "Operator aritmatika digunakan untuk melakukan operasi matematika pada data atau nilai variable. Berikut ini adalah operator aritmatika:\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "Operator | Deskripsi\n",
        "---|---\n",
        "`**` | Eksponen (Pemangkatan)\n",
        "`*` | Perkalian\n",
        "`/` | Pembagian\n",
        "`//` | Floor division\n",
        "`%` | Modulus\n",
        "`+` | Penambahan\n",
        "`-` | Pengurangan\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "![aritmatika.PNG](data:image/png;base64,)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "JXQuMd20EvWT"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# 2.1"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "d_bQPf-MrwAr"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "x = 5\n",
        "y = 3\n",
        "\n",
        "exponent = x ** y\n",
        "multiplication = x * y\n",
        "division = x / y\n",
        "floor_division = x // y\n",
        "modulus = x % y\n",
        "addition = x + y\n",
        "subtraction = x - y\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f'{x} ** {y} = {exponent}') # x pangkat y\n",
        "print(f'{x} * {y} = {multiplication}')\n",
        "print(f'{x} / {y} = {division}')\n",
        "print(f'{x} // {y} = {floor_division}') # pembagian dengan pembulatan ke bawah\n",
        "print(f'{x} % {y} = {modulus}') # sisa hasil bagi x dengan y\n",
        "print(f'{x} + {y} = {addition}')\n",
        "print(f'{x} - {y} = {subtraction}')"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "KllZVH0WW1AQ",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "78aaefa2-0473-4df5-ef18-eb29addd1a59"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "5 ** 3 = 125\n",
            "5 * 3 = 15\n",
            "5 / 3 = 1.6666666666666667\n",
            "5 // 3 = 1\n",
            "5 % 3 = 2\n",
            "5 + 3 = 8\n",
            "5 - 3 = 2\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
